  m_Name: NPC_KahinBilge
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Argos.NPC.NPCData
  npcName: "K\xF6yl\xFC \xC7ocuk"
  period: "M\xD6 800, Frigya"
  personality: "M\xD6 800 Frigya's\u0131nda ya\u015Fayan, y\u0131rt\u0131k giysili,
    yoksul bir k\xF6y \xE7ocu\u011Fu. Korkmu\u015F ve \xE7ekingendir. Bir gece k\xF6y\xFCn
    yak\u0131n\u0131ndaki yolda bir t\xFCccar\u0131n at arabas\u0131n\u0131n pusuya
    d\xFC\u015F\xFCr\xFCl\xFCp devrildi\u011Fine \u015Fahit oldu ve o g\xFCnden beri
    deh\u015Fet i\xE7inde. \xC7ocuksu, k\u0131sa ve sade c\xFCmlelerle konu\u015Fur,
    bazen kekeler. G\xF6rd\xFCklerini anlatmaya korkar \xE7\xFCnk\xFC sald\u0131rgan\u0131n
    kendisine zarar vermesinden \xE7ekinir; g\xFCven kazan\u0131l\u0131rsa yava\u015F
    yava\u015F a\xE7\u0131l\u0131r. Soylulardan, b\xFCy\xFCklerin i\u015Flerinden
    ve tap\u0131naktan \xFCrker. Asla yalan uydurmaz; korktu\u011Funda susar ya da
    'bilmiyorum' der. D\xF6nemine ait olmayan (modern) \u015Feyleri anlamaz."
  portrait: {fileID: 5737509497191939921, guid: e380d0e7ecf8e6d43a636c41db269ad6, type: 3}
  portraitMouthOpen: {fileID: -8855417057224807401, guid: 7a9e6ffc23268f94db932a578f963f01, type: 3}
  knownFacts:
  - "O gece k\xF6y\xFCn yak\u0131n\u0131ndaki yolda bir at arabas\u0131n\u0131n devrildi\u011Fini
    g\xF6rd\xFCm."
  - "Araban\u0131n atlar\u0131 \xFCrkm\xFC\u015F, \xE7\u0131\u011Fl\u0131k \xE7\u0131\u011Fl\u0131\u011Fa
    her yere ka\xE7\u0131\u015F\u0131yordu."
  - "Arabadaki ya\u015Fl\u0131 adam yere y\u0131\u011F\u0131lm\u0131\u015Ft\u0131,
    hi\xE7 k\u0131p\u0131rdam\u0131yordu."
  hiddenFacts:
  - "Devrilen araban\u0131n yan\u0131nda soylu giysili gen\xE7 bir adam vard\u0131."
  - "O gen\xE7 adam arabadan bir \u015Fey al\u0131p tap\u0131na\u011Fa do\u011Fru
    ko\u015Ftu."
  - "\xC7ok korktu\u011Fum i\xE7in bug\xFCne dek kimseye anlatmad\u0131m."
  mandatoryFinalFact: "O gen\xE7 adam\u0131 tan\u0131d\u0131m; t\xFCccar\u0131n o\u011Fluydu.
    Babas\u0131n\u0131n arabas\u0131n\u0131 yolda devirip onu orada \xF6l\xFCme terk
    etti."
  patienceCount: 6
